WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.794 --> 00:00:10.292
Javier and Will were in the gym, getting ready for their first audition day—the one at

2
00:00:10.293 --> 00:00:15.941
school. They knew what they were looking for in new dancers. They'd made copies of Tessa's

3
00:00:15.942 --> 00:00:25.109
score sheet, and they asked Mr. D. to help them evaluate dancers. "Remember, you can't just

4
00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:28.355
choose your friends for dance crew," the teacher warned. He took a seat at the judging

5
00:00:28.356 --> 00:00:36.845
table. "Okay, Mr. D.," Javier said cheerfully. "I don't understand why he has to help us,"

6
00:00:36.846 --> 00:00:39.599
Will complained as the boys walked toward the gym doors. "He doesn't know anything about hip-hop."

7
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:47.345
"That's true, but we have to be nice to him. We need him here—and at the

8
00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:52.597
Best American Talent audition." "I know, but I still think . . ." Will opened a

9
00:00:52.598 --> 00:00:56.165
door and stopped. The hallway outside the gym was packed with guys. Some were dancing to

10
00:00:56.166 --> 00:01:00.502
music on their headphones; the rest were talking loudly. "Whoa!" Javier shook his head in disbelief.

11
00:01:00.503 --> 00:01:04.404
The two boys ran back to the judging table. "Mr. D., you should see all the

12
00:01:04.405 --> 00:01:13.238
guys out there!" Javier said. "Where did they come from?" Mr. D. looked uncomfortable. "I might

13
00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:15.310
have mentioned Best American Talent to some of my classes." "Mr. Deeeee!" Will groaned. "Will, run

14
00:01:15.311 --> 00:01:21.899
into the office and make more copies of these." Mr. D. held out the score sheets.

15
00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.573
"Javier and I will get everybody organized." By the time Will returned, all 32 guys had

16
00:01:25.574 --> 00:01:31.481
signed in and were ready to start the audition. "There are too many dancers to evaluate

17
00:01:31.482 --> 00:01:34.227
at once," said Mr. D. "Break them into groups of eight, so we can get a

18
00:01:34.228 --> 00:01:40.298
good look at everybody." "This will take forever!" Will moaned, but Javier was already dividing the

19
00:01:40.299 --> 00:01:49.633
crowd. "Does everybody know how to kick step?" Javier asked the first group. Most of the

20
00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:57.198
kids nodded, but a few shook their heads. "All right, I'll show you. There are a

21
00:01:57.199 --> 00:02:01.361
couple of ways to do this—in place and traveling across the floor. Traveling is easier, so

22
00:02:01.362 --> 00:02:05.115
let's start with that." Javier soon had everyone dancing across the gym floor. One tall kid

23
00:02:05.116 --> 00:02:14.931
kept bumping into the others. "You in the middle." Mr. D. checked the names on his

24
00:02:14.932 --> 00:02:23.597
sheet. "Charlie, is it? Move to the end, so you don't bump into anyone." Javier waited

25
00:02:23.598 --> 00:02:31.090
for Charlie to move. "Now let's try that faster this time with some upper body movements—like

26
00:02:31.091 --> 00:02:39.837
this—and some music." Will started the music, and Javier demonstrated the step. "Come on, everybody!" Charlie

27
00:02:39.838 --> 00:02:49.007
led the line of dancers across the gym, but he wasn't paying attention, and he crashed

