00:02:49.008 --> 00:02:57.903
into the volleyball net. He fell to the floor with the netting draped around his shoulders.

29
00:02:57.904 --> 00:03:03.394
"We should probably take that net down," said Mr. D. There was a break while two

30
00:03:03.395 --> 00:03:11.205
hip-hop hopefuls untangled Charlie. Then they helped Mr. D. put away the net. "We're going to

31
