66
00:07:03.543 --> 00:07:10.944
"I'll keep that in mind." Javier shut the door and lay down on his bed. Music,

67
00:07:10.945 --> 00:07:22.426
clothes, choreography. There was too much to do. He'd never tell Tessa this, but he longed

68
00:07:22.427 --> 00:07:34.517
